Description: strict JSON encode/decode for R via system libjansson
 An R-safe profile of RFC 8259: duplicate-key rejection at any depth,
 NUL and invalid-UTF-8 rejection, exact double round-trip, classed
 error conditions with source coordinates.
 .
 Binary build linked against the system Jansson library: target
 machines need only the libjansson4 runtime, never a compiler or
 libjansson-dev.

